      "note": "ADR-0099 keeps `null` in the lens enum: the coordinator's verdict covers no single lens. What changed is the rest of the instance -- ADR-0097 makes `run_id` required and §2.3 makes `reviewed_sha` required, so the old body no longer reached the lens constraint it means to pin."
